    "long_instructions": "# Investigating Computer Hardware\r\n\r\n1. Examine the computer hardware presented here. Click parts and attach them to the motherboard where they belong.\r\n2. Once added, **Power On** the computer to see if it boots up.\r\n3. Experiment by adding / removing parts while the computer is running or trying to start the computer without parts. What happens as a result?",
